      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, the \"vanishing into the ether\" thing is exactly what i mean lol. it's super frustrating. do you have any specific tips for audit-proofing my small expenses? like, is there a certain way i should label them so an auditor doesn't get suspicious if they see a bunch of random small amounts?",
